What was taken is AriaNg's community-maintained translation work: the aria2
option names and descriptions, and labels whose English wording was inherited
unchanged.  What this project added is the message-key structure itself, the
strings AriaNg never had, the entries AriaNg left untranslated, and the
contextual corrections.  Each affected file is therefore a modified derivative;
src/i18n/locales/README.md records the per-language breakdown.

